# Local build output
/build/
/out/
*.o
*.obj
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ilk

# Local emulator state; deliberate small fixtures belong in tests/fixtures/
/runtime/
*.log

# Validation products: Guest images, signatures and traces are regenerated by
# tests/guest and tests/official, so they are never committed.
*.elf
*.bin
*.sig
*.hex
*.jsonl
*.dump
*.map

# Deliberate exception to the two rules above: the frozen golden baseline IS a
# committed artifact. It shares their extensions, so the two files are
# re-included explicitly. Without this the baseline cannot be committed and the
# regression silently reports SKIP everywhere except the machine that generated
# it -- a check that guards nothing while looking present.
!tests/guest/golden/probe.trace.jsonl
!tests/guest/golden/probe.signature.hex

# External monitoring channel. The authorised monitor overwrites this file
# periodically, so it is working state rather than project documentation; the
# conclusions worth keeping go into STATUS and commit messages.
/MONITOR_REPORT.md

# Credentials and machine-local configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Editor and operating-system files
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
